  "reference": "2 Bakolinto 11",
  "copyright": "PUBLIC DOMAIN",
  "verseCount": 33,
  "content": [
    {
      "name": "chapter",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "number": "11",
        "style": "c",
        "sid": "2CO 11"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "11",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Paulo na batūng'wa ba nyalomolomo",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CO 11:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nalīmulomba mugeme ho hangī hado ū kwiyūmīlīja nabo ū būchilū chilū bone, gīt'ūmo mukīītīlaga na kale! ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CO.11.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CO.11.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CO 11:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū nene nalī na wilu bo ng'wa Mulungu kūlwa nguno ying'we, nguno nakamulūnja kūlwa ngosha ūmò, gīkī namufunye kūlī Kilisito gītī kūng'winha munhya nsūhya, ūyo atī na shilingo nūūlū hado. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CO.11.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CO.11.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CO 11:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Alīyo nandije kogoha, mutizūbiza ng'wahūmbūūlilwe a maganiko ging'we ng'wīnga ū mu ng'hana, nū mu wela bo ng'wa Kilisito, gīt'ūmo nzoka īkanemba lembela Eva mu nyasala sala! ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CO.11.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CO.11.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CO 11:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Namanile gīkī mushikile kwiyūmīlīja nūūlū munhū akiza alīmulomeela ya ng'wa Yesu ūngī, ūyo tūtamulomeelile bise, nūūlū ya ng'wa moyo ūngī ūyo ng'walī mutang'wanukūlile, nūūlū mbika yīngī ya ng'hūlū jawiza ījo tūtamulomeelile a bise. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CO.11.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CO.11.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CO 11:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Alīyo nalībona gīkī, a batūng'wa a bataale batanilebije mhayo gose gose nū nene. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CO.11.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CO.11.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CO 11:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Īkī nūūlū nakabiza nagehelilwe būdūla mu kalūngalūngīle, alīyo ītī gīko ū mu witegeleja; nguno h'ūmo twang'oolekegije mu yose. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CO.11.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CO.11.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CO 11:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nūūlū hamo nakahūba ū kūmulomeela dalali ī Ng'hūlū Jawiza ja ng'wa Mulungu? Ū nene nidohyaga gīkī mugūngūhiwe a bing'we. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CO.11.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CO.11.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CO 11:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ī mheela īyo nanukūlaga kūlwa kūmutūmamīla bing'we, napandīkaga kūfuma kū banhū ba kanisa jingī! ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CO.11.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CO.11.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CO 11:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nūūlū ū mu kūgehelwa aho naalī hamò ning'we, nahene natabizile nigo kūlī munhū ose ose, nguno ū būgehelwa bone būkamalwa na badūgū abo bakiza kūfuma Makedonia. Nilang'hanaga natizūbiza nigo ū kū bing'we; nīyo nī haha nataalī nilang'hanile. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CO.11.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CO.11.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CO 11:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ūmo ng'hana ya ng'wa Kilisito īlī mulī nene, ū wikumīlīja bone wenūbū atīho wa kūbūhuumūja nūūlū hado ū mu sī ya Akaya. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CO.11.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CO.11.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CO 11:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ī gīsī nibūlī? Kolaga hamo muliganika natamutogilwe a bing'we? Ū Mulungu amanile ūmo namutogelilwe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CO.11.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CO.11.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CO 11:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Alīyo nakongeja kwīta ūmo nakwītīlaga na kale, nabahuumūje a bigīmba gīmbi; bagayiwe ī nzīla ya koolecha gīkī īyo bakwītaga īlenganīlile nū mumo tūkwītīlaga a bise. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CO.11.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CO.11.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CO 11:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nguno a bene batūng'wa ba kwigīmbīja, balomolomo ba balomolomo; bakwiyītaga kūbiza batūng'wa ba ng'wa Kilisito. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CO.11.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CO.11.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CO 11:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Gwike ū mhayo gwenūyū gūtī gwa kūkumya, nguno nū Shetani ng'wenekīlī akiyītaga kūbiza malaika w'isana! ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CO.11.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CO.11.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CO 11:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hū kūhaya gūtī ntaale no ū gwa batūng'wa bakwe nabo ū kwiyīta kūbiza gītī batūmami ba ng'hana; alīyo ī ng'halīlo yabo īkūbiza gītī h'ūmo īlī ī ng'halīlo ya milīmo yabo!",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CO.11.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CO.11.15"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Kūluha kūlwa nguno ya nīmo gwa būtūng'wa",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CO 11:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CO.11.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CO.11.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CO 11:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Leki nahaye hangī gīkī, atizigela munhū ose ose wa kūniganikīla ū nene gīkī nalī nchilū chilū; gwike nahene nūūlū mubize mukūniganikīlaga gīko, nanukūlagi gīt'ūmo nalī, nane nabonele ho mhayo gwa kwihaya, nūūlū gwa malīngīīla! ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CO.11.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CO.11.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CO 11:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Īyo nalīyīhaya yenīyī ītī gīt'ūmo Seeba atogelilwe; nalīhaya ya nyachilū chilū mu wikumīlīja bo nyagimu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CO.11.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CO.11.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CO 11:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Alīyo īkī bingī bakwikumīlījaga kūlwa mihayo ya mu mīlī, nū nene leki nikumīlīje, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CO.11.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CO.11.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CO 11:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "nguno mulī biyūmīlīja nū kū bachilū chilū, īkī mulī na masala. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CO.11.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CO.11.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CO 11:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "A bing'we mukiyūmīlījaga nūūlū munhū ūmutūūla mu būsese, nūūlū ūlya sabo jing'we; nūūlū ūng'wiboneela, nūūlū ūmudoosa, nūūlū ayūmupaala mapī! ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CO.11.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CO.11.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CO 11:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Leki nahaye nūūlū īkī nalīcha soni; gashi ī gete a bise tūkabiza babbomheezu no īkī tūkaleka ū kwīyīta ī yenīyo! Gwike ūlū munhū akwibonaga gīkī alī ngimu, leki nahaye gītī nalī nchilū chilū; nū nene h'ūmo nalī. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CO.11.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CO.11.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CO 11:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Angū, a boi Bahebulania? Nū nene h'ūmo nalī. Hamo Baisilaeli? Nū nene chene. Balī ba lūganda lo ng'wa Abulahamu? Nū nene nalī chene. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CO.11.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CO.11.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CO 11:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Balī batūmami ba ng'wa Kilisito? Nahaye gītī natīnīkile ntwe, ū nene na kūkīla ho a henaho! Ng'hangala ningī no nakūbizaga mu milīmo midito, nū kūtungwa mu jeela naho hingī, nū kūtūlwa naho hingī dūhū, pyī nū kūbiza mu nhabaala ja kūcha! ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CO.11.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CO.11.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CO 11:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ng'hangala itanò nalītūlwa mbooko makūmi adatū na kenda kūfuma kū Bayudaya. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CO.11.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CO.11.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CO 11:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū kūtūlwa ī milang'ha ng'hangala idatū, hama nakapondwa mawe kamò, ū kūtubīla mu nyanza nashisha kadatū. Lūkangala lūngī nakashinga mu būjiba bo nyanza būjikū pe na līīmi tole! ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CO.11.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CO.11.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CO 11:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Natamalaga ī ng'endo, hama nīyo ng'hangala ningī nakūbizaga mu kwihīga, kwihīga kūlwa myongo, kwihīga kūlwa biibi, kwihīga kūfuma kū banhū bane, kwihīga kūfuma kū banhū ba mahanga. Pye a hose kwihīga dūhū, ībize mu mizengo, nūūlū kū matogolo, nūūlū mu nyanza, nūūlū kūfuma kū badūgū ba nyalomolomo! ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CO.11.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CO.11.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CO 11:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hama nī milīmo īyo nakūtūmamaga nayo midito, nīyo mu makoye mataale. Ng'hangala ningī būjikū pe, na mu kūkoyiwa nota, hamò na būtuubu kūlwa kūdīla nzala. Nū gwa kūzuuka na kūgayiwa myenda mu shikū ja mbeho nago gūtī ngeni! ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CO.11.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CO.11.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CO 11:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hama a higūlya ya mihayo īyo īdūgije kūbonwa yenīyo, nakūsheedekejiagwa nigo gwa kūjilang'hana pyī ī kanisa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CO.11.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CO.11.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CO 11:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nani ūyo alakoyiwe būgokolo nane naleke kūkoya? Nani ūyo alipamiwe nane naleke kūpīnīhala? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CO.11.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CO.11.29"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
