          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū nene ūlū yūnigeleelwa kwikumīlīja, nakwikumīlīja kūlwa būgokolo bone. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CO.11.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CO.11.30"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "31",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CO 11:31"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū Mulungu ū Nkumīlījiwa wa shiku jose, ū Ise wa ng'wa Seeba wise Yesu Kilisito, amanile gete gīkī natūlomalomaga. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CO.11.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CO.11.31"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "32",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CO 11:32"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "32",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū mu Damasko nū ng'wene ū ntwale akalagījiwa na ntemi Aleta kūgūlang'hana ū nzengo gīkī anidime. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CO.11.32",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CO.11.32"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "33",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CO 11:33"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "33",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Alīyo nūpīla, nguno nakatūūlwa mu shigabbu nūbītījiwa ng'widilisha lya mu ndugu nichiwa, nūbiza napūlūgūka ū mu makono gakwe.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CO.11.33",
